OL,3,ANotorious gangland enforcer Paul Ferris
OL,4,Adies aged 62
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Glasgow gangland enforcer who wrote
OL,7,Fbooks about his underworld experiences
OL,8,Fhas died at the age of 62.
OL,10,FPaul Ferris is believed to have died on
OL,11,FTuesday night at the city's Queen
OL,12,FElizabeth University Hospital after a
OL,13,Fshort illness.
OL,15,FHe was cleared of the murder of crime
OL,16,Fboss Arthur Thompson's son, Arthur
OL,17,FThompson Jnr, in 1992, before being
OL,18,Fjailed for seven years in 1998 for
OL,19,Fgun-running.
OL,21,FHis first book, The Ferris Conspiracy,
OL,22,Fwas published in 2001.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
